-- Status: UNVERIFIED
-- Original: for every natural number n, the product n times n plus one is divisible by two
-- Frozen-target-sha256: e09be7b0fd470bdb4af728e7055d7abaf8d67ac8b687bd8823afb66f6d5418fd

MODULE [wit_even_prod]

THEOREM [wit_even_prod]:
  CLAIM:
    for every natural number n, the product n times n plus one is divisible by two

PROOF OF [wit_even_prod]:

  [1] HAVE if two divides k times k plus one then two divides k plus one times k plus two
      BY expanding the product and peeling off a multiple of two.

  [2] SHOW for every natural number n, the product n times n plus one is divisible by two
      BY [1], induction on n, base by evaluation and step by the lemma above.

  QED BY [2].
